00:57:36.580 --> 00:57:55.650
<v Ira Glass>When we first ran this show, we invited listeners to take the raw tracks of Starlee's song and mix their own versions. The response was kind of incredible-- 129 entries. You can hear the winners of our breakup song contest-- including the version you're hearing right now, by We Were Pirates-- at our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can also listen to-- for free-- any of our old shows in our archive.
<v Ira Glass>当我们第一次播出这期节目时，我们邀请听众利用斯塔莉歌曲的原始轨道，混音出他们自己的版本。反应简直太惊人了——收到了129份参赛作品。你可以在我们的网站thisamericanlife.org上听到我们分手歌曲比赛的获胜者——包括你现在听到的这个由“海盗队”（We Were Pirates）演唱的版本。在网站上，你还可以免费收听我们档案中任何往期的节目。

